{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d0afef86c3555c168f9ef78e4e5c1537c400eca2b74eeda329ff7965903e041c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6400d779acd87f34e47d0cf8fa9f288feb59232b254264f7704af45259c7a1",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！\n收到的包裹，我刚刚打开了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c929871d803aa723a8a985ccad800f70eeedb892bb7c7bb7e5b81c568f38fc",
      "text": "发行公司送来的礼物，原来是我演的那个角色的\n手办啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:503554b1abf83a91fe3d42da235eadaef92e96e7b7211dd5c912b67424eb53fe",
      "text": "其实这个，我之前就有点在意了。\n姿势和小道具都做得超级讲究啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11eed7391d81415fe1f8dd435fe7412d7f075ba4d25bc1fa105fedb4104a940d",
      "text": "果然这种作品的手办，\n姿势充满魄力就是好啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a18b7174bfecfdf05db181be05aab965a5a348cc16b0978905d438c112ceeaff",
      "text": "电影里的动作场面也很帅气对吧？\n完全被漂亮地再现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e93a210a72c9514280bfc0387014bdf10692ac71c051a3298680ca7d1058af9e",
      "text": "附带的吉祥物角色，\n细节部分也做得很棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40b339cc1d5e65b621b9a235e3ef947cb4ffb3a5fd86071bc4057b3a567e2eb8",
      "text": "在电影里也一直一起行动，\n要摆的话得摆在主角旁边才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c2528802dfd396b1bfef18de8cb49d947806dfe192108845596e8913ed1fbce",
      "text": "要是有机会我也想亲自道谢，不过要是你见到了\n负责人，能帮我转达一声感谢吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7",
      "text": "当然可以",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e",
      "text": "明白了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_b:2_4_001_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b92b2408834f9513a975d38c3434e4f6f88556b1bfd8683709bd20138985fb6",
      "text": "嗯，拜托你了。\n那就明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
